stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "Starting soon" as StartingSoon
  state "Not held" as NotHeld
  state "Awaiting summary" as AwaitingSummary
  [*] --> Planned: scheduled
  Planned --> StartingSoon: classroom opens (CFG-L)
  Planned --> Cancelled: cancel
  Planned --> NotHeld: scheduled end passes unstarted
  StartingSoon --> Live: tutor presses Start lesson
  StartingSoon --> Cancelled: cancel
  StartingSoon --> NotHeld: scheduled end passes unstarted
  Live --> AwaitingSummary: End lesson or auto-end
  AwaitingSummary --> Live: Restart within 60 min of auto-end
  AwaitingSummary --> Complete: summary Completed
  AwaitingSummary --> Complete: No summary needed
  AwaitingSummary --> Missed: nobody joined, tutor marks Missed
  Complete --> AwaitingSummary: Undo within window
  NotHeld --> Live: Start anyway until midnight
  NotHeld --> Planned: Reschedule
  NotHeld --> Cancelled: Mark as cancelled
  Cancelled --> Planned: Undo within 5 minutes
  Complete --> [*]
  Missed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
